This type of cable clip is ideal for quickly keeping coiled up a small cable such as headphones, or thin and short charger cables, for example. The leather color is according to your choice.

## Decreasing prices

Decreasing price from 3 ordered:

- 3 for 25 € (8.3 each)
- 4 for 32 € (8 each)
- 6 for 45 € (7.5 each)

## Colours of the knob

The knob (button) is proposed in 3 colours:

- Silver
- Brass
- "Silver Gun" (silver with patina)

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

